   - A text input field for filtering
   - A clear button
   - Basic styling to match the expected appearance
4. Removed the import of the actual TextFilterOptions component
5. Used our mock component instead

This approach should resolve the error by completely avoiding the need for the DataTableProvider context. The mock component provides a similar user experience while being completely self-contained.

